postgres knob schema: version 18 (default), family database, port 5432
KEY	KIND	RANGE	DEFAULT	CLASS	CATEGORY
shared_buffers	size	-	128mb	rolling	memory
max_connections	int	1..10000	100	rolling	connections
work_mem	size	-	4mb	instant	memory
class: instant = takes effect live without a restart (dynamic); rolling = supervised rolling restart of the carrier (static)
size values: <number><b|kb|mb|gb>, e.g. 512mb (units are case-insensitive)
set knobs with --set KEY=VALUE on 'fleetly databases create' or 'fleetly databases update'
